  <data name="boxNotes.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>DISCLAIMER: 
Editing things in here can break the game (especially since it is still in development). 
Things that are read-only: 
 * Floor Number
 * Floor Layout
 * Class/Form/Title
Things that are editable, with issues:
 * Portrait parts (body, clothes, hair, etc.)
Things that are fully editable:
 * Turn
 * Stats
   * Name
   * Sex
   * Hunger
   * Health (and Max Health)
   * Mana (and Max Mana)
   * Attack 
   * Defense
   * Willpower 
   * Speed
   * Evade
   * Gold
 * Skin Color
 * Hair Color
 * Inventory</value>
  </data>
